        "question_text": "<p>What is the interior angle of a regular hexagon?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The formula for the interior angle of a regular <i>n</i>-sided polygon is:<br>$\frac{(n-2) \times 180\u00b0}{n}$. For a hexagon (<i>n</i> = 6), the calculation is:<br>$\frac{(6-2) \times 180\u00b0}{6} = \frac{720\u00b0}{6} = 120\u00b0$.</p>",
